<!-- Cache-busted theme load.
     Forgejo's own stylesheet URL only changes when Forgejo is upgraded, so a browser
     that cached theme-stik.css keeps the old skin for the life of its cache entry.
     This extra link uses a version we control: bump ?b= on every theme change and
     returning visitors get the new look immediately. It loads after Forgejo's copy,
     so identical rules win on order. -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/theme-stik.css?b=3">
